  <documents xsi:type="kernel:StructuredDocument" id="548f529c-57c9-5862-baf8-603eb5b5ac74" name="Developer completion and demo boundary" format="MARKDOWN" content="Compose a client-facing stock view from two adapter calls with explicit partial failure.&#10;Map itemCode/availableQty/itemVersion deterministically to sku/stockAvailable/sourceVersion; quantities are nonnegative integers.&#10;Newest full snapshot wins per SKU; older snapshots never revert destination stock.&#10;Stable exchange ID and payload hash resolve timeout-after-commit; provider 429 is retriable, malformed contracts fail permanently.&#10;Operator replay is authorized and audited; simulators use controlled study endpoints and credentials.&#10;Generated function shells require real Go application code. Review endpoint reachability, resource permissions, contracts and naming before deployment." description="Reviewed demonstration model; not a deployment/acceptance certificate" />
